Description: Stochastic Fractal Search SQLite loadable extension (Community)
 sqlite3-fractalsql is a SQLite loadable extension exposing a
 fractal_search(vector, query) scalar function plus fractalsql_edition()
 and fractalsql_version() helpers, backed by a LuaJIT-compiled
 Stochastic Fractal Search optimizer.
 .
 Community Edition (v1.0.0): Salimi 2014 canonical SFS with Gaussian
 diffusion and greedy sniper selection.
 .
 Zero runtime dependency: LuaJIT, libgcc, and libstdc++ are all
 statically linked into the extension; the only import is glibc.
 .
 After installation, load the extension in any SQLite session:
 .
     SELECT load_extension('/usr/local/lib/sqlite3/fractalsql');
 .
 Suitable for edge / serverless deployments (Vercel, AWS Lambda),
 Turso / libSQL, Cloudflare D1 (where extensions are permitted),
 React Native / Flutter mobile apps, and desktop SQLite usage.
